id: searx-release-pat-secret
title: Configure RELEASE_PAT for protected automated release pushes
description: The release environment has NPM_TOKEN but lacks the maintainer token required for Auto Release to atomically push the generated release commit and tag through protected master.
type: Issue
status: blocked
priority: 0
tags[4]: blocked,configuration,github-actions,release
created_at: "2026-07-21T17:45:57.693Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-21T17:54:31.090Z"
deadline: "2026-07-28T17:45:57.693Z"
assignee: repository-owner
author: codex-root
acceptance_criteria: RELEASE_PAT appears in gh secret list --env release; manual Auto Release dry run passes; production push mode can create a release commit and tag through branch protection
definition_of_ready: Repository owner provides or configures a suitable maintainer token without exposing it in logs.
parent: searx-repo-health-2026
risk: high
confidence: 100
sprint: 2026-07-release-automation
release: next
blocked_reason: Requires repository-owner credential configuration outside source control.
reporter: codex-root
severity: high
environment: GitHub Actions release environment
repro_steps: Run gh secret list --repo unbraind/searxng-cli --env release; only NPM_TOKEN is listed.
expected_result: Both NPM_TOKEN and RELEASE_PAT are configured for their separate publication and protected-push responsibilities.
actual_result: "NPM_TOKEN exists; RELEASE_PAT is absent, so scheduled production Auto Release will fail fast before mutation."
affected_version: repository configuration 2026-07-21
component: GitHub Actions release environment
regression: false
customer_impact: New releases cannot be cut automatically until the secret is configured.
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind}:
  searx-auto-release,discovered_from,"2026-07-21T17:45:57.693Z",codex-root,null
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:45:57.693Z",codex-root,Live gh secret inventory on 2026-07-21 showed NPM_TOKEN only; RELEASE_PAT was absent.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:45:57.693Z",codex-root,"Required permissions: push the release commit to protected master and create the vYYYY.M.D tag. Store only as a release-environment secret."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:45:57.693Z",codex-root,GITHUB_TOKEN pushes do not trigger downstream push workflows; a maintainer PAT or GitHub App token is required for the pm-cli-style tag handoff.
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/auto-release.yml,project,Fails fast when RELEASE_PAT is absent
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  "bun run test:release",project,180
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  docs/release-process.md,project,Required release environment secrets
body: Add a narrowly scoped maintainer RELEASE_PAT to the GitHub release environment. Do not substitute GITHUB_TOKEN because GitHub suppresses recursive push workflows and protected master may reject it.
